<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Micron Electronics started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Micron Electronics started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said its analyst Kurt King has started coverage of Micron Electronics Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Micron, a manufacturer of personal computers, is 79-percent owned by semiconductor chip maker, Micron Technology Inc.</p>
</text>
